"Build a complete dashboard overview page with a gradient background from slate-50 to blue-50, sticky header with glassmorphic nav, grid of metric cards with hover effects, interactive charts with smooth animations, and a data table with search and filters. Use professional blue/indigo color scheme throughout and ensure mobile responsiveness."
```

#### **KPI Metric Cards Grid**
