"Create a grid of KPI metric cards for a SaaS dashboard. Each card should have a white/transparent background with backdrop blur, colored icon in a gradient circle, large metric number with subtle animation on load, percentage change indicator with trending arrow, and smooth hover effects that scale and add shadow. Include loading skeleton states."
```

